sentences.text:
The main features of the Bill are - "(a) to (c) ........;
(d) single reference point for all matters relating to Food Safety and standards,
regulations and enforcement;
(e) shift from mere regulatory regime to self-compliance through Food Safety Management Systems;
(f) responsibility on food business operators to ensure that food processed,
manufactured, imported or distributed is in compliance with the domestic food laws;
and (g) provision for graded penalties depending on the gravity of offence and accordingly, civil penalties for minor offences and punishment for serious violations."
